 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h  | 34 +++++++++-
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_xpon.c | 77 ++++++++++++++++++-----
 3 files changed, 149 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

